<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx2.SS6" title="In Appendix ‣ AR-VLA: True Autoregressive Action Expert for Vision–Language–Action Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">V-F</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Discussion and Limitations</span></span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
