<div id="Sx2.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx2.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">To maintain temporal consistency, we employ specific history and masking parameters. The generalist model is optimized for long-horizon stability with a larger history window, while the specialist model operates at higher frequencies for precise bimanual tasks.</p>
</div>
<figure id="Sx2.T7" class="ltx_table">
